#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:6
#: 05eed7e8bae14c55a1c22688ad3ed9b6
msgid "ESC Telemetry Based Harmonic Notch Setup"
msgstr "基于 ESC 数传的谐波陷波滤波器设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:11
#: 307b5bfcb8d1475181a69545c756f906
msgid ""
"If ESCs with telemetry are used (either via a separate telemety wire or bi-"
"directional dshot) then the harmonic notch reference frequency can be set "
"dynamically using ESC telemetry.  The harmonic notch reference frequency "
"parameter, :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` and/or "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ <INS_HNTC2_FREQ>`, is used to indicate the lowest motor"
" speed for which the ESC telemetry should be used to dynamically set the "
"harmonic notch reference frequency.  It is recommended that this be set to "
"below the hover frequency but above the "
":ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>` frequency. The bandwidth of the "
"notch (and any enabled harmonic notches "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_HMNCS<INS_HNTCH_HMNCS>` or "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_HMNCS<INS_HNTC2_HMNCS>`) will maintain a ratio set by the "
"_FREQ/_BW params as the center frequency moves."
msgstr ""
"如果使用带数传功能的 ESC（通过独立数传线或双向 DShot），则可利用 ESC 数传动态设置谐波陷波参考频率。谐波陷波参考频率参数 "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTC2_FREQ>` 用于指定使用 ESC 数传动态设置谐波陷波参考频率的最低电机转速。建议将其设置为低于悬停频率但高于 "
":ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>` 频率。随着中心频率的变化，陷波带宽（及任何启用的谐波陷波 "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_HMNCS<INS_HNTCH_HMNCS>` 或 "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_HMNCS<INS_HNTC2_HMNCS>`）将按 _FREQ/_BW 参数设定的比例保持不变。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:13
#: 372f9e3ac38645efb3bcef108cccd746
msgid ""
"Set the :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_REF "
"<INS_HNTC2_REF>` parameter to 1, which will disable scaling of the harmonic "
"notch, and set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` and/or "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_MODE <INS_HNTC2_MODE>` to 3 to select ESC telemetry."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_REF "
"<INS_HNTC2_REF>` 设置为 1（将禁用谐波陷波的缩放），并将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>`"
" 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_MODE <INS_HNTC2_MODE>` 设置为 3 以选择 ESC 数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:14
#: 825307d81c5f4cdd89b60c4cfa520869
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_MODE "
"<INS_HNTC2_MODE>` = 3 to use BLHeli ESC telemetry support to set the "
"harmonic notch frequency. This requires that your ESCs are configured "
"correctly to support BLHeli telemetry via :ref:`a serial port<blheli32-esc-"
"telemetry>` or are Bi-directional DShot capable and using Ardupilot "
"autopilot and firmware which supports that capability."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_MODE "
"<INS_HNTC2_MODE>` = 3，以使用 BLHeli ESC 数传支持来设置谐波陷波频率。这要求您的 ESC 已正确配置为通过 "
":ref:`串口<blheli32-esc-telemetry>` 支持 BLHeli 数传，或具备双向 DShot 能力，并使用支持该功能的 "
"ArduPilot 飞控和固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:15
#: 74166953b911420db334adf5a4e23571
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_ENABLE <INS_HNTCH_ENABLE>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_ENABLE"
" <INS_HNTC2_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable the harmonic notch"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_ENABLE <INS_HNTCH_ENABLE>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_ENABLE "
"<INS_HNTC2_ENABLE>` 设置为1以启用谐波陷波滤波器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:16
#: 0f268f3670514d709a24ed0aafc6430f
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTC2_FREQ>` = below the hover frequency - you can easily determine "
"this by performing a gentle hover and looking at the ESC telemetry data"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTC2_FREQ>` 设置为低于悬停频率的值——可通过轻柔悬停并查看 ESC 数传数据来轻松确定"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:17
#: 0e74f59afe554481b1945c08a5f7c4e8
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_BW <INS_HNTCH_BW>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_BW "
"<INS_HNTC2_BW>` = half of INS_HNTCH_FREQ"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_BW <INS_HNTCH_BW>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_BW <INS_HNTC2_BW>` "
"设置为 INS_HNTCH_FREQ 的一半"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:19
#: 8fc33f7bf21341e896e9724545738a54
msgid ""
"If you set the multi-source option (i.e. a notch per motor) mentioned below,"
" the bandwidth should not be half the frequency. It should be greatly "
"reduced as more notches cause more phase lag (i.e. latency), thus the "
"bandwidth needs to be reduced to maintain a reasonable phase lag, else "
"oscillation and a poorer tune will result despite the more accurate "
"filtering compared to throttle-based filtering. The suggested starting point"
" is setting the _FREQ/_BW params to 4/1 ratio instead of the default 2/1. "
"This is because for notch filters, a wider bandwidth causes a greater phase "
"lag per notch. You can also use the `Filter Tool "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/FilterTool/>`__ to check the phase lag"
" for your chosen filtering settings. If your phase lag is higher than it was"
" with the throttle-based notch, then you can try reducing the bandwidth even"
" further, balancing the phase lag and the amount of noise in the system."
msgstr ""
"如果设置了下文提到的多源选项（即每个电机一个陷波），带宽不应为频率的一半。由于更多的陷波会造成更多的相位滞后（即延迟），应大幅降低带宽以保持合理的相位滞后，否则尽管相比基于油门的滤波具有更精确的滤波效果，系统仍将出现振荡和调参效果变差的问题。建议将"
" _FREQ/_BW 参数的初始比例设为 4/1，而非默认的 2/1。这是因为对于陷波滤波器，更宽的带宽每个陷波会造成更大的相位滞后。您也可以使用 "
"`滤波器工具 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/FilterTool/>`__ "
"来检查所选滤波设置的相位滞后。如果您的相位滞后高于基于油门的陷波，可以尝试进一步降低带宽，在相位滞后和系统噪声之间取得平衡。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:24
#: 2400c3febdc34fdc88d6401d6028ae3a
msgid "Center Frequency Slewing"
msgstr "中心频率平滑过渡"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:26
#: 66e7d9ff7cf247cab3b6dc83616eac67
msgid ""
"The rate at which the harmonic notch frequency is updated has a big impact "
"on noise in the PID loops. Slower update rates mean that the frequency has "
"larger step changes which result in what is called shot noise. Faster update"
" rates reduce this and is the primary reason why using bi-directional dshot "
"with ESC Telemetry reporting of RPM benefits the system overall."
msgstr ""
"谐波陷波频率的更新速率对 PID "
"环路中的噪声有重大影响。较慢的更新速率意味着频率出现较大的阶跃变化，从而产生所谓的散粒噪声。更快的更新速率可减少此问题，这也是使用双向 DShot 配合"
" ESC 数传报告转速能整体提升系统性能的主要原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:28
#: 8495f6c8b324496f96744a67871bea57
msgid ""
"By default the update rate is 200Hz and where the source of frequency "
"information is slower than that - for instance when using ESC telemetry "
"where the maximum rate that can be sustained is about 100Hz - ArduPilot will"
" slew the frequency changes at 200Hz to avoid large steps. The slewed rate "
"is the rate that is reported by ESC telemetry, although the raw rate can be "
"seen in the logs as well."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，更新速率为 200Hz。当频率信息来源的速度低于此值时（例如使用 ESC 数传时，可持续的最大速率约为 100Hz），ArduPilot "
"将以 200Hz 的速率对频率变化进行平滑过渡，以避免大的阶跃。平滑后的速率即为 ESC 数传所报告的速率，原始速率也可在日志中查看。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:30
#: 67595d8fb9ef4a2a9150dc80fdec55c1
msgid ""
"On systems with faster CPUs (H7 based autopilots) it is possible to update "
"the harmonic notch at the main loop rates used for VTOL aircraft (typically "
"300-400Hz set by :ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>`) by setting bit 3 "
"of the notch options, i.e."
msgstr ""
"在配备较快 CPU 的系统（基于 H7 的飞控）上，通过设置陷波选项的第 3 位（即下方设置），可以按 VTOL 飞行器主循环速率（通常由 "
":ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE<SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` 设置为 300-400Hz）更新谐波陷波："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:32
#: ac589f63c87b4b22aaee1b3cad108d17
msgid ""
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS<INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` and/or "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>` = 4"
msgstr ""
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS<INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` 和/或 "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:34
#: 87120fc4d6d543d7aa7f1c207b685132
msgid ""
"Slewing ensures that the step changes at each update tick are smooth, but "
"for optimum system performance you can use bi-directional Dshot ESCs which "
"can deliver frequency updates at 400Hz, using the above option, if possible "
"."
msgstr ""
"平滑过渡可确保每次更新时的阶跃变化平滑，但为获得最佳系统性能，如果可能，可使用双向 DShot ESC，结合上述选项，以 400Hz "
"的频率提供频率更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:37
#: f2d57403152d4784b35e27fa0ae853ed
msgid "Checking Harmonic Notch Effectiveness"
msgstr "检查谐波陷波有效性"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:38
#: a2cd969c0d96419db6bf474abcfb4585
msgid ""
"Once the notch filter(s) are setup, the effectiveness of them can be checked"
" by again measuring the  frequency spectrum of the output of the filters. "
"Refer back to the :ref:`common-imu-batchsampling`  or :ref:`common-raw-imu-"
"logging` page for this."
msgstr ""
"设置好陷波滤波器后，可以通过再次测量滤波器输出的频谱来检查其有效性。请参阅 :ref:`common-imu-batchsampling` 或 "
":ref:`common-raw-imu-logging` 页面了解相关操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:41
#: 9ee1ecb698494ec6875a0f2a4a7c2dc2
msgid ""
"While the log analysis of noise frequencies is not absolutely required prior"
" to notch setup for RPM based mode, the logging and analysis done for the "
"Confirmation flight using that method can be done in order to confirm the "
"noise elimination, if desired."
msgstr ""
"虽然对于基于 RPM 的陷波设置模式，在设置前进行噪声频率日志分析并非绝对必要，但如果需要，可以在确认飞行中进行日志记录和分析，以验证噪声消除效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:44
#: 31cf418e596b4511b5c519ebf4728b79
msgid "Multi-Source"
msgstr "多源"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:46
#: aa7a1bec0d234064a5b064a5ccdf0fe4
msgid ""
"By default the ESC based harmonic notch will use an average of the "
"individual motor frequencies in order to drive the center frequency of the "
"notch, this average is then used as the first harmonic and other harmonic "
"notches are added at higher frequency multiples of the first harmonic. It is"
" possible to configure the harmonics to instead be first harmonics per "
"motor. This gives four notches - one for each motor - that exactly tracks "
"the motor speed. In dynamic flight this can give much better noise "
"attenuation."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，基于 ESC "
"的谐波陷波将使用各电机频率的平均值作为陷波中心频率，该平均值作为第一谐波，其他谐波陷波则添加在第一谐波的整数倍频率处。也可以将谐波配置为每个电机各自的第一谐波。这将产生四个陷波（每个电机一个），精确跟踪各电机转速。在动态飞行中，这可以提供更好的噪声抑制效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telem-based-notch.rst:48
#: a989547f045c410099dc787139f6239e
msgid ""
"To configure this option set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS <INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` and/or "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS <INS_HNTC2_OPTS>` to \"2\". You also need to reduce the"
" bandwidth of the notch filter to around "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ<INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` / number of motors, otherwise you will"
" likely have too high phase lag leading to worse PID performance. See the "
"note above for more details."
msgstr ""
"要配置此选项，将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS <INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS "
"<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>` 设置为 「2」。同时需要将陷波滤波器带宽降低至约 "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ<INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` 除以电机数量，否则可能出现过高的相位滞后，导致 PID "
"性能下降。详见上方说明。"
